#. type: Title ===
#: en/data-publishing/modules/ROOT/pages/standards-publishing.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "BioCASe / ABCD "
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-publishing/modules/ROOT/pages/standards-publishing.adoc:32
msgid "The http://www.biocase.org[Biological Collection Access Service], commonly referred to as *BioCASe*, is an international network linking biological collections data from natural history museums, botanical/zoological gardens and research institutions. BioCASe relies on the https://www.tdwg.org/standards/abcd/[Access to Biological Collections Data (ABCD) data exchange standard], which TDWG also administers."
msgstr "http://www.biocase.org[Biological Collection Access Service] は、一般的にはBioCASeと呼ばれ、自然史博物館、植物園、動物園および研究機関から集められた生物コレクションデータをつなぐ国際ネットワークです。BioCASe relies on the https://www.tdwg.org/standards/abcd/[Access to Biological Collections Data (ABCD) data exchange standard], which TDWG also administers。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-publishing/modules/ROOT/pages/standards-publishing.adoc:34
msgid "https://www.biocase.org/products/protocols/[BioCASe Protocol]"
msgstr "https://www.biocase.org/products/protocols/[BioCASeプロトコル]"

